{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object approached, grab and move it to destination; or approach object, scan properties and explore area.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ExploreArea    />\"",
